## Summary
Amber-Rose Berry, a South African teenager, has become the youngest South African woman to swim the English Channel. The achievement sets a new national age-group record for the challenging open-water crossing.

## Key Points
- Amber-Rose Berry successfully swam the English Channel
- She is the youngest South African woman ever to complete the crossing
- Berry is a teenager from South Africa
- The record was reported by RT.com


